custom_components/daylight/solar.py adapts the solar-phase diagnostic and
one-hour polar fallback from adaptive-lighting's
custom_components/adaptive_lighting/color_and_brightness.py. It resolves local
dates to UTC and distinguishes actual astronomical events from synthetic
lighting anchors. Lighting timing and interpolation are implemented separately.
